  "priorExpiration": "2005-08-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 504.02 Format of the EAP.\n\n(a) The EAP shall be submitted on 8½ x 11 paper, hard copy, and in pdf format.\n\n(b) In order to facilitate the development of an EAP, the owner may use the EAP template found at the following link: https://www.des.nh.gov/climate-and-sustainability/storms-and-emergencies/dam-emergency-action-plans.\n\n(c) The content of the EAP shall be standardized as follows:\n\n(1) Table of Contents;\n\n(2) Section 1, Notification Flowchart;\n\n(3) Section 2, General Responsibilities;\n\n(4) Section 3, Preventive Action; and\n\n(5) Appendices, including:\n\na. Appendix A, Project Description;\n\nb. Appendix B, Impact of Breach;\n\nc. Appendix C, Inundation Map; and\n\nd. Appendix D, Posting of the Plan.\n\n(d) The required contents of each section or appendix shall include the information identified in Env-Wr 504.03 through Env-Wr 504.09, as applicable.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; ss by #4452, eff 8-1-88; amd by #4580, eff 2-27-89; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss and moved by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97 (formerly Env-Wr 506.02); ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wr 505.02)",
